{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello there!</strong> Sorry for the rush, but could you start tomorrow? Don\u2019t worry\u2014think of the details as \u201con-the-job training.\u201d You did study the materials I gave you in advance\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the newest security guard at <strong>Hololive office</strong>. Your task is simple but vital: protect each talent\u2019s privacy. Counterfeit IDs, forged documents, tall tales\u2014bring nothing but your wits, your knowledge of the talents, and a whole lot of love. Minimize the damage, prove your worth, and earn that full-time contract!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/extras/URID_WIP20250605C.gif?t=1767870463\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pulse-pounding <strong>inspection quiz game</strong>.<br>Check each arriving talent\u2019s ID card and profile\u2014and if that\u2019s not enough, conduct a quick interview. Sniff out impostors perfectly disguised as your favorite talents. Let a fake slip through and their favorite snacks (or their darkest secrets!) might get stolen\u2026 But block the real talent by mistake and expect an angry call from upper management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a seven-day probation period as the rookie guard. You\u2019ve got a limited number of lives; lose them all and you\u2019re fired\u2014hold on to them and you\u2019re hired!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one talent and guard them forever in an endless survival challenge. One mistake means instant game over. Climb the talent-specific leaderboards with a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u306f\u3058\u3081\u3066\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\u30af\u30d3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\u30ae\u30ea\u5408\u683c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\u3059\u3070\u3089\u3057\u3044\u6210\u7e3e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff10\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff11\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff12\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff13\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff14\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"},{"name":"\uff15\u671f\u751f\u62c5\u5f53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691000/f0060b6cfdf8dbb307a402df7ed4b4aeb716ef9a.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691000?t=1767870